Output tapes/demo.gif

Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Type "rmsctl status"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl robots list"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl robots show so101-pi"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl robots telemetry so101-pi"
Enter
Sleep 4s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl datasets list"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 0.5s

Type "rmsctl --help"
Enter
Sleep 4s
